  "details": "I suggest that VRC adds capability for vrchat that allows the android app to track your head for head tracking if a controller or wireless keyboard/mouse is connected for player movement. I say this for people that use Google Cardboard or something similar and adds a bit of immersion to the android app.\n\n   To sum it up, when activated, it displayed something like this <image attached> and can make the head with the person when wearing a headset like google Cardboard <image attached> and have something like an BT Xbox controller or BT keyboard/Mouse for player movement controls.\n\n        -PebbleCat",
